WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.805
Lord Crumley stood in the center of the shop.

2
00:00:03.806 --> 00:00:06.877
Master Crossland knelt beside him.

3
00:00:06.878 --> 00:00:11.615
He was measuring the lord’s leg from the knee to the foot.

4
00:00:11.616 --> 00:00:16.545
"We have very nice silk from Italy," said the tailor.

5
00:00:16.546 --> 00:00:21.015
"Edward, please show the golden silk to Lord Crumley."

6
00:00:21.016 --> 00:00:24.868
Edward carried the silk over to Lord Crumley.

7
00:00:24.869 --> 00:00:27.935
The nobleman hardly looked at it.

8
00:00:27.936 --> 00:00:32.870
"Is that all?" he yawned in a bored voice.

9
00:00:32.871 --> 00:00:34.728
"Ouch! Be careful!

10
00:00:34.729 --> 00:00:38.887
You’ve pinched my leg!" he yelled at the tailor.

11
00:00:38.888 --> 00:00:40.874
Then he kicked him.

12
00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:45.690
Edward put down the silk and jumped on a nearby stool.

13
00:00:45.691 --> 00:00:49.402
"How dare you treat my master like that!"

14
00:00:49.403 --> 00:00:53.269
shouted Edward in his most dramatic voice.

15
00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:55.301
"Have you no shame?

16
00:00:55.302 --> 00:00:57.349
Have you no pity?"

17
00:00:57.350 --> 00:01:02.618
"Ssh, Edward," said the tailor. "Get down."

18
00:01:02.619 --> 00:01:06.874
"What are you doing?" whispered Vinnie to Edward.

19
00:01:06.875 --> 00:01:11.282
Lord Crumley was angry and turned bright red.

20
00:01:11.283 --> 00:01:15.243
He looked as if his head would explode.

21
00:01:15.244 --> 00:01:19.805
"My lord, I’m so sorry," said the tailor.

22
00:01:19.806 --> 00:01:23.332
"My apprentice didn’t mean to upset you."

23
00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:28.208
"This is your apprentice?" shouted Lord Crumley.

24
00:01:28.209 --> 00:01:30.608
"Throw him out immediately!"

25
00:01:30.609 --> 00:01:35.077
"But, my lord, he’s just a boy," said the tailor.

26
00:01:35.078 --> 00:01:39.420
"Toss him into the streets!" cried the angry man.

27
00:01:39.421 --> 00:01:43.850
"That’s fine!" shouted Edward. "I’ll leave.

28
00:01:43.851 --> 00:01:47.708
I won’t spend my life measuring cloth for lords and ladies.

29
00:01:47.709 --> 00:01:49.613
Come on, Vinnie!"

30
00:01:49.614 --> 00:01:55.069
Edward grabbed Vinnie’s arm and they both ran out of the shop.

31
00:01:55.070 --> 00:02:01.477
At that same moment, Mandy and Lady Katherine were also leaving the house.

32
00:02:01.478 --> 00:02:06.683
"Have you been to the Globe Theater, Mandy?" asked Lady Katherine.

33
00:02:06.684 --> 00:02:10.133
"No, my lady," replied Mandy.

34
00:02:10.134 --> 00:02:16.866
"William Shakespeare and his actors are performing a great play," said Lady Katherine.

35
00:02:16.867 --> 00:02:19.374
"It is called Romeo and Juliet.

36
00:02:19.375 --> 00:02:21.150
Would you like to go?"

37
00:02:21.151 --> 00:02:26.011
"You are so kind to me, Lady Katherine," said Mandy.

38
00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:30.183
Lady Katherine smiled at her.

39
00:02:30.184 --> 00:02:35.521
"If you don’t have a family, you may stay at my home," she said.

40
00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:38.019
"You will be treated well."

41
00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:43.963
"Thank you . . . but . . ." Mandy could not finish her answer.

42
00:02:43.964 --> 00:02:46.696
She was thinking about Vinnie.

43
00:02:46.697 --> 00:02:50.201
"Where is he?" she wondered.

44
00:02:50.202 --> 00:02:54.547
Then Mandy and Lady Katherine got in the carriage.

45
00:02:54.548 --> 00:02:58.991
Edward and Vinnie were running fast through the streets.

46
00:02:58.992 --> 00:03:03.325
Edward ran down lanes and jumped over fences.

47
00:03:03.326 --> 00:03:07.676
Vinnie had a hard time keeping up with him.

48
00:03:07.677 --> 00:03:13.400
Finally, Edward stopped on the corner of a wide street.

49
00:03:13.401 --> 00:03:19.562
"Vinnie, do you want to see something wonderful?" said Edward, out of breath.

50
00:03:19.563 --> 00:03:22.749
"What do you mean?" asked Vinnie.

51
00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:27.106
"England has more than just servants and lords," shouted the boy.

52
00:03:27.107 --> 00:03:30.948
"We have the theater!"

53
00:03:30.949 --> 00:03:35.672
"But isn’t Master Crossland going to be angry?" asked Vinnie.

54
00:03:35.673 --> 00:03:38.072
Edward wasn’t listening.

55
00:03:38.073 --> 00:03:41.342
"We’re finally going to the Globe, Vinnie!" he said.

56
00:03:41.343 --> 00:03:48.391
"Follow me!"

